{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Eternal Laughter Circus has plunged into chaos! Enraged clowns, demanding long-overdue wages, have gone to war against their former owner. You have to stand up for the last bastion of fun - the circus tent! Take everything you can get your hands on - from throwing pies and jester's hammers to flamethrowers and chainsaws - and fight back against the raging army of redheads. Your task: hold the line at any cost and prevent the clowns from destroying the tent to the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clown Madness is a dynamic 2D pixel art platformer with elements of a shooter and base defense. Squeeze everything out of the arsenal of circus madness, fighting off waves of increasingly ferocious and unusual clowns. Every second counts - protect the symbol of your circus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High Difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Responsive Controls</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895770?t=1760019868","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895770?t=1760019868","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895770/28f415f19643e15b4bb189b719f45e894678c065/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760019868","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895770/28f415f19643e15b4bb189b719f45e894678c065/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760019868","categories":[{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Eternal Laughter Circus has plunged into chaos! Enraged clowns, demanding long-overdue wages, have gone to war against their former owner. You have to stand up for the last bastion of fun - the circus tent! Take everything you can get your hands on - from throwing pies and jester's hammers to flamethrowers and chainsaws - and fight back against the raging army of redheads. Your task: hold the line at any cost and prevent the clowns from destroying the tent to the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clown Madness is a dynamic 2D pixel art platformer with elements of a shooter and base defense. Squeeze everything out of the arsenal of circus madness, fighting off waves of increasingly ferocious and unusual clowns. Every second counts - protect the symbol of your circus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High Difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Responsive Controls</p>","developers":["Esemte Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895770/4d40741b79546a6f58a20e8dd11e5375d978a5a5/header.jpg?t=1760019868","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895770/1175124873/199299e7f6a7f7cd41fce972b8408e348aabc177/1754834770/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757799247","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895770/1175124873/199299e7f6a7f7cd41fce972b8408e348aabc177/1754834770/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757799247","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895770/1175124873/199299e7f6a7f7cd41fce972b8408e348aabc177/1754834770/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757799247","id":257181099,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257181099/22ebf5298aa9f23b97ad3ace58e8c7e42444e44d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757799247"}],"name":"Clown Madness","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","sa